## Mixing notes

- Costus Olifac, Castoreum, Tobacco: add into stack B premix before the floral core so they melt into the background.
- Myristic Acid 10% in warm DPG (mp 54°C) — prepare before session.
- Safraleine 10% w/w DPG — micropipette.
- Everything else unchanged from the 21% master.

## Expected effect

- Root register: damper, hairier, waxier — real rhizome earth (Costus + Carrot + Myristic).
- Background: opoponax glow + cypriol root-oud bridge + mossy floor + faint tobacco/castoreum leather.
- Hedonic: lactone/tonka/hay lift valence ≈ +2–3; animalics ≈ −2 → net ~84–86, with more dimensionality.
- Air profile unchanged in the top (Orivone/Irione/Iso E still lead the headspace); new depth lives in heart→drydown.

Computational build sheet only — physical compounding, maturation, blotter evaluation, IFRA/safety review remain separate gates.
